Match the following groups with the correct odd one out and reasoning:

Column I:
(a) {Rose, Jasmine, Lily, Teak}
(b) {64, 81, 100, 110}
(c) {Triangle, Square, Pentagon, Cylinder}
(d) {Mercury, Silver, Gold, Copper}

Column II:
(i) Cylinder — it is a 3D solid while the others are 2D polygons
(ii) Teak — it is a tree, not a flower
(iii) 110 — it is not a perfect square
(iv) Mercury — it is liquid at room temperature while others are solid metals

