Match the following semantic groups with the correct odd one out:

Column I:
(a) {Malaria, Typhoid, Diabetes, Dengue}
(b) {Photosynthesis, Respiration, Transpiration, Pollination}
(c) {Watt, Joule, Ampere, Kilogram}
(d) {Earth, Jupiter, Sun, Saturn}

Column II:
(i) Sun — it is a star, not a planet
(ii) Kilogram — it measures mass, while the others are electrical/energy units
(iii) Diabetes — it is a metabolic disorder, not an infectious disease
(iv) Pollination — it is a reproductive process, not a metabolic/physiological process

